# The positive control to the Aura that stays in exile: Perilous Snare exiles Bot2's Sheltered by Ghosts, enchanting
# Ornithopter, until the Snare leaves the battlefield. When Bot1 crafts Braided Net with the Snare (CR 702.167a), the
# Aura returns under its owner's control (CR 610.3c), and Bot2 chooses which of its creatures it enchants as it enters
# (CR 303.4f): Doomed Traveler, not the Ornithopter it was on before (a new object, CR 400.7), a 2/1 with lifelink. Its
# enters trigger exiles Bot1's Mox Pearl until it leaves; the Snare's link is over.

